dbcsr
------------------------------------------
DBCSR is a library designed to efficiently perform sparse matrix-matrix
multiplication, among other operations.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libdbcsr-devel-2.10.0-1bl1
  libdbcsr2.10-2.10.0-1bl1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  liblapack0-3.12.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  liblapack-devel-3.12.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/cp2k/dbcsr

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/cp2k/dbcsr/releases/download/v2.10.0/dbcsr-2.10.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dbcsr-2.10.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dbcsr-2.10.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dbcsr-2.10.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dbcsr-2.10.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbcsr2.10-2.10.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbcsr-devel-2.10.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(dbcsr)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/dbcsr.README
  /usr/share/doc/dbcsr/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/dbcsr/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/dbcsr/README.md

(libdbcsr2.10)
  /usr/bin/cygdbcsr-2.10.dll

(libdbcsr-devel)
  /usr/include/dbcsr_api.mod
  /usr/include/dbcsr_config.mod
  /usr/include/dbcsr_tensor_api.mod
  /usr/lib/cmake/dbcsr/DBCSRConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/dbcsr/DBCSRConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/dbcsr/DBCSRTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/dbcsr/DBCSRTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libdbcsr.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/dbcsr.pc

